    {
      "title": "redirect, notFound, Scroll and Loading",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "redirect, notFound, Scroll and Loading",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. redirect and notFound",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`redirect(url)`: ==307==, but ==303== in server actions",
                "`permanentRedirect(url)`: ==308==",
                "Valid in server components, actions, route handlers",
                "`notFound()`: nearest `not-found.js`, ==404==",
                "Unmatched URLs fall through to the root `not-found`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Both ==throw== a special error: never inside `try/catch`",
                "Call after the try block, or rethrow in the catch",
                "Client components: `useRouter().push`; `redirect()` is render-only, not event handlers"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Scroll",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Default: top of the new page, or first segment element if off-screen",
                "`<Link scroll={false}>` keeps position",
                "`router.push(url, { scroll: false })` keeps position"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. loading.js",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Wraps the page in an automatic `<Suspense>`: instant fallback, content streams in",
                "Does ==not== cover layouts",
                "Same route, new search params: ==no re-run=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "<Suspense key={params.toString()}",
                "  fallback={<Skeleton />}>",
                "  <Results />",
                "</Suspense>"
              ],
              "note": "a changed key shows the fallback again"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Never catch ==redirect== or ==notFound== errors."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Navigation Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
