          "title": "Navigation Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Link and useRouter",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Option",
                "Effect"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`<Link href>`",
                  "==Soft== navigation; prefetches in viewport (production only)"
                ],
                [
                  "`prefetch={false}`",
                  "Prefetch off"
                ],
                [
                  "`scroll={false}`",
                  "Keeps scroll position"
                ],
                [
                  "`replace`",
                  "Swaps the history entry"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`useRouter` from ==next/navigation==: `push`, `replace`, `back`, `forward`, `refresh`, `prefetch`",
                "{red:Client components only}",
                "`usePathname` gives the path; `useSearchParams` gives ==read-only== URLSearchParams",
                "`useSearchParams` needs a `<Suspense>` boundary"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Server Side",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Call",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`redirect()`",
                  "{blue:307} (303 in server actions)"
                ],
                [
                  "`permanentRedirect()`",
                  "{blue:308}"
                ],
                [
                  "`notFound()`",
                  "{blue:404}"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Never in try/catch",
              "text": "`redirect` and `notFound` work by **throwing**. Call them outside the `try`/`catch`."
